  "qualification": {
    "category": "not a fit",
    "rationale": "Ascending IT is a managed IT services and cybersecurity provider (MSP) based in Nampa, Idaho. ForgeX's target segment is owner-led home-service contractors (HVAC, plumbing, and electrical) with 10 to 75 staff who pay for leads. Because Ascending IT operates in B2B technology management and already maintains client ticketing and billing portals, it falls outside ForgeX's target vertical and qualification criteria."
  }
